title: "DUP Presenter"
message: >-
  If you use DUP Presenter in engineering demos, product walkthroughs, or
  research pipelines, please cite it using these metadata. Retain the MIT
  LICENSE notice in redistributions and check third-party licenses (including
  Remotion) before commercial use.
