url: "https://github.com/Gruver87/dup-presenter"
abstract: >-
  Declarative 3D Product Presentation Engine by DUP Labs: converts validated
  JSON or Markdown decks into 1080p/vertical MP4 presentations using neural TTS
  (Edge TTS / Silero v5 RU / Kokoro-82M v1.0 EN), word-level karaoke captions
  (Edge WordBoundary / local faster-whisper ASR), Remotion 4 3D slide templates,
  two-pass -16 LUFS broadcast mastering, and a fail-closed Media QA Gate.
keywords:
  - remotion
  - video-generation
  - presentation
  - tts
  - karaoke-captions
  - ffmpeg
  - python
  - typescript
  - mcp
  - fail-closed
  - dup-labs
